<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Enough (prod. APRO)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Colde, 정유미, APRO</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Enough</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1JB8Y5r1Pee8E8b7J1Kf1q</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.650" end="00:20.260">그저 그렇게</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.260" end="00:23.690">흘러가는 하루가</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.690" end="00:28.380">때론 덜컥 두려워</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.380" end="00:31.600">뭐라도 해야 했지</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.600" end="00:36.700">어디쯤 인지 너는 내게 물었고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.700" end="00:39.760">난 답을 하지 못했어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.760" end="00:44.640">그토록 바라왔던 순간이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.640" end="00:47.890">지금인지도 모른 채</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.890" end="00:52.490">그대여 나를 있는 그대로</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.490" end="00:56.040">사랑해주면 안 돼?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.040" end="01:00.710">그렇게 나를 바라봐주면</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.710" end="01:05.860">난 충분해, 그걸로 충분해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.860" end="01:10.790">Enough, enough, enough, enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.790" end="01:13.670">그대로 그렇게</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.670" end="01:18.890">Enough, enough, enough, enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.890" end="01:21.650">그걸로 충분해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.650" end="01:25.500">천천히, 때로는</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.500" end="01:29.910">흘러가듯 그렇게</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.910" end="01:32.900">시간을 둔 채로</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.900" end="01:36.410">말없이 바라봤지</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.410" end="01:41.320">어디쯤 인지 너는 내게 물었고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.320" end="01:44.200">난 답을 하지 못했어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.200" end="01:49.330">그토록 바라왔던 순간이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.330" end="01:52.450">지금인지도 모른 채</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.450" end="01:56.700">그대여 나를 있는 그대로</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.700" end="02:00.530">사랑해주면 안돼?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.530" end="02:04.920">그렇게 나를 바라봐주면</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.920" end="02:10.150">난 충분해, 그걸로 충분해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.150" end="02:15.330">Enough, enough, enough, enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.330" end="02:18.170">그대로 그렇게</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.170" end="02:23.300">Enough, enough, enough, enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.300" end="02:25.990">그걸로 충분해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.990" end="02:29.850">라, 라리라</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.850" end="02:33.780">라, 라리라</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.780" end="02:37.890">라, 라리라</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.890" end="02:42.260">라, 라리라</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.260" end="02:50.260" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.760" end="02:59.640">그걸로 충분해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.640" end="03:03.640" /></div></body></tt>